/**
 * @defgroup StMuDSTEMC StMuDSTMaker/EMC — Legacy EMC Micro-DST
 * @brief Historical standalone EMC micro-DST maker (superseded by StMuEmcCollection in COMMON/).
 * @details
 * The EMC/ package provides a self-contained EMC micro-DST system that predates
 * the integrated EMC support in the main MuDST.  It was written by Alexandre
 * A. P. Suaide (initial version August 2001) and converts StEvent into compact
 * ROOT-persistable objects written to a separate .emcEvent.root file.
 *
 * The package can also operate in reverse: reading .emcEvent.root files and
 * reconstructing a minimal StEvent for downstream analysis makers.
 *
 * New analyses should use StMuDst::emcCollection() (StMuEmcCollection, COMMON/)
 * and StMuEmcUtil instead of this package.
 *
 * All implementation files reside in the examples/ subdirectory.
 * @{
 */

/**
 * @class StEmcMicroDstMaker
 * @brief STAR maker that converts StEvent to StEmcMicroEvent (write mode) or
 *        StEmcMicroEvent to StEvent (read mode).
 *
 * In write mode (default) the maker applies event and track filters, creates
 * one .emcEvent.root output file per input file, and fills a TTree "EmcTree"
 * with a single branch "MicroEvent" (StEmcMicroEvent, split=99).
 *
 * In read mode (activated by calling addMicroEventFile()) the maker reads
 * entries from a TChain and optionally reconstructs StEvent objects via
 * StEmcMicroUtil.
 *
 * Two StEmcFilter instances are exposed: mPFilter (event + primary-track
 * selection) and mGFilter (global-track selection).  Default cuts require
 * EMC presence, a primary vertex, |z| < 100 cm, and multiplicity 0–500000.
 */

/**
 * @class StEmcMicroUtil
 * @brief Bidirectional conversion utility between StEvent and StEmcMicroEvent.
 *
 * getMicroEvent(StEvent*) runs the full StEvent → StEmcMicroEvent conversion:
 * event info, tracks, V0 vertices, four BEMC sub-detectors (hits, clusters,
 * points), and FPD summary.
 *
 * getStEvent(StEmcMicroEvent*) reconstructs a minimal StEvent including
 * StEventSummary, StL0Trigger, StTriggerDetectorCollection, primary vertex,
 * global and primary tracks (with StHelixModel, dE/dx, and fit traits),
 * V0 vertices, and StEmcCollection (hits, clusters, barrel points).
 */

/**
 * @class StEmcMicroEvent
 * @brief Top-level event container for the standalone EMC micro-DST.
 *
 * Stores all event-level quantities needed for EMC physics analyses:
 * run and event IDs, Unix timestamp, trigger token, primary vertex position,
 * original multiplicity, L0 trigger word, CTB sum, ZDC east/west ADC sums and
 * z-vertex, BBC east/west ADC sums and z-vertex, EMC high-tower and patch ADC
 * arrays (300 entries each), bunch-crossing IDs (7-bit and full), spin bits,
 * and magnetic field.
 *
 * Aggregates: StEmcMicroCollection (EMC), StFpdMicroCollection (FPD),
 * primary tracks (TObjArray of StEmcMicroTrack), global tracks (TObjArray),
 * and V0 vertices (TObjArray of StEmcMicroV0).
 */

/**
 * @class StEmcMicroCollection
 * @brief Per-event EMC container holding hits, clusters, and points.
 *
 * Sub-detector indexing: 1=bemc (towers), 2=bprs (pre-shower),
 * 3=bsmde (SMD eta), 4=bsmdp (SMD phi).
 *
 * Provides getHit(det, id), getCluster(det, id), getPoint(id) and the
 * corresponding count accessors.  Owns all contained objects and deletes
 * them in clear().
 */

/**
 * @class StEmcMicroHit
 * @brief Single-tower or single-strip detector hit.
 *
 * Stores the geometrical address (module UChar_t, eta bin UChar_t, sub bin
 * UChar_t), the raw ADC value (Short_t), and the calibrated energy (Float_t).
 */

/**
 * @class StEmcMicroCluster
 * @brief EMC cluster: a group of geometrically adjacent hits with a centroid.
 *
 * Stores centroid eta, phi, sigmaEta, sigmaPhi, total energy, and an array
 * of pointers to the constituent StEmcMicroHit objects (non-owning: hits are
 * owned by the parent StEmcMicroCollection).
 */

/**
 * @class StEmcMicroPoint
 * @brief EMC point matched across sub-detectors.
 *
 * Stores the physical position (eta, phi, deltaEta, deltaPhi), total energy,
 * and fit chi-square, together with arrays of associated StEmcMicroCluster
 * pointers for each of the four sub-detectors.
 */

/**
 * @class StEmcMicroTrack
 * @brief Compact track representation for EMC analyses.
 *
 * Persists total momentum p, eta, phi, curvature, track origin in 3D, charge,
 * DCA (scalar and signed), chi2 (stored as Int_t = chi2*1000 to save space),
 * fit points, maximum possible points, TPC hits, dE/dx mean and error,
 * number of dE/dx points, track length, original track-node index (for
 * StEvent reconstruction), and a flag byte.
 */

/**
 * @class StEmcMicroV0
 * @brief V0 decay vertex with two daughter tracks.
 *
 * Stores the decay vertex position (x, y, z) and owns two StEmcMicroTrack
 * daughter objects (indices 0 and 1).  Deleted in the destructor.
 */

/**
 * @class StFpdMicroCollection
 * @brief Compact Forward Pion Detector summary.
 *
 * Stores the FPD trigger token and the sum ADC values for the nine FPD
 * detector regions: North, South, Top, Bottom, PreShower1, PreShower2,
 * SmdX, SmdY.
 */

/**
 * @}
 */
